{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21741","headline":"和乐天重题别东楼 · 元稹","name":"和乐天重题别东楼","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"山容水态使君知，楼上从容万状移。\n日映文章霞细丽，风驱鳞甲浪参差。\n鼓催潮户凌晨击，笛赛婆官彻夜吹。\n唤客潜挥远红袖，卖垆高挂小青旗。\n賸铺牀席春眠处，乍卷帘帷月上时。\n光景无因将得去，爲郎抄在和郎诗。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21741.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21741","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}